OL,3,GNEWSACar thieves target Nissan Jukes as
OL,4,A11 stolen in one county in 24 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar thieves stole 11 Nissan Jukes over
OL,7,Fa 24-hour period in one county, police
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FThe crime wave hit Caerphilly county
OL,11,Flast Thursday and Friday, with security
OL,12,Fexpert Michael Fraser saying the
OL,13,Fvehicles were frequently targeted
OL,14,Fbecause they have "valuable spare
OL,15,Fparts" and were "relatively easy to
OL,16,Fsteal".
OL,18,FFigures from the Driver and Vehicle
OL,19,FLicensing Agency (DVLA) show the Nissan
OL,20,FJuke Tekna is the UK's most stolen car
OL,21,Fso far in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
