OL,3,GNEWSACar thieves target Nissan Jukes as
OL,4,A11 stolen in one county in 24 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Gwent Police confirmed
OL,7,Fall 11 Nissan Jukes had been recovered,
OL,8,Falong with a Kia Niro and a Nissan
OL,9,FNavara that were also reported stolen.
